      "passage_id": "passage_46969ff15baff2f682df4428",
      "supporting_excerpt": "There is no bright-line rule for substantial transformation. CBP evaluates each case individually, and the same type of processing may or may not constitute substantial transformation depending on the specific facts.","relevance_explanation": "Establishes lack of clear rules contributing to evidence conflict.","company_applicability": "national_or_sector_context","temporal_status": "date_not_established"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_ad2ef35dd3f917f3e3d54e3b",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Simple/minor assembly usually fails (origin stays with key components): - Energizer (CIT 2016): assembling ~50 flashlight parts in the U.S. did not change origin.","relevance_explanation": "Provides historical precedent for simple assembly failing transformation test.","company_applicability": "national_or_sector_context","temporal_status": "date_not_established"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_4a741e798570a07b490d93e1",
      "supporting_excerpt": "CBP determined that the SMT and wave soldering processes incorpo-rated a large number of discrete parts onto a printed circuit board, which was a sufficiently ‘‘complex and meaningful’’ operation so as to result in a sub-stantial transformation of the parts making up the product’s PCBA.","relevance_explanation": "Contrasts with simple assembly rulings, showing complexity can shift origin.","company_applicability": "national_or_sector_context","temporal_status": "date_not_established"
    },
    {
      "passage_id": "passage_0fede4264a1288bb84a7396d",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Typically, “substantial transformation” is determined by U.S. Custom and Border Protection (CBP) on a case-by-case basis. CBP examines the totality of circumstances to determine whether a change in the good’s name, character, or use occurred due to the manufacturing or processing operations in the last country of production","relevance_explanation": "Confirms case-by-case determination creates uncertainty for general answers.","company_applicability": "national_or_sector_context","temporal_status": "date_not_established"
    }
  ]
